   -> the point-mass limit reaches ANY gravity ratio, because g_eq -> 0
      at break-up -- but only at a/c = 3/2, where the figure ceases to exist.
      So the two limiting structures disagree about the ceiling by 15x in a/c
      and by infinity in gravity ratio.  Nothing here is geometry.

